# What clew decides, fixture by fixture.
#
# fixture rule severity path:line, or "fixture -" where nothing is found.
#
# The pack version and the catalogue revision name the set of rules and rows.
# These lines name the decisions, which is what a published figure needs in
# order to be reproducible: a rule whose logic changes fails here rather than
# passing quietly under the same number.
#
# A fixture numbered from 20 is silent on purpose. Each is a case some rule's
# own prose promises it does not fire on, so a rule that starts firing there is
# as much a regression as one that stops firing at all.

